WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.168
This query first subtracts admit time from discharge
time That produces

00:00:06.181 --> 00:00:11.830
an interval It also converts the interval to seconds
using EXTRACT

00:00:11.843 --> 00:00:17.823
EPOCH divides by the number of seconds in a day and
rounds the result The

00:00:17.849 --> 00:00:23.606
interval is a typed duration The numeric day value
is an analytical

00:00:23.619 --> 00:00:25.987
representation derived from that duration
